IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`
IMPORT `uro-part1-intro`
IMPORT `uro-part5-pension-credit`
IMPORT `uro-part6-esa`
IMPORT `uro-part7-universal-credit`
IMPORT `uro-part8-revocation`

-- Tests of uro-part5-pension-credit (art 29), uro-part6-esa (arts 30 and 31, Schedules 11 and 12),
-- uro-part7-universal-credit (arts 32 and 33, Schedule 13) and uro-part8-revocation (art 34). Every expected figure is
-- read by hand from the line of the text cited beside it (uksi-2026-148.txt). The art 29(4) and art 30(7)
-- non-dependant deductions are tested in uro-tests-non-dependant-deductions.l4.

GIVEN old IS A NUMBER
      new IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`the pair of sums in the part 5 to 8 tests` old new MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF old, new

