§ `Articles 30(2) and (3) -- prescribed amounts for a single claimant (src:395-396, 733-744)`

-- Arguments: the case falls within paragraphs 2 to 7 of Schedule 2 to the 2017 Regulations; the claimant satisfies s 2(2); s 2(3);
-- is a member of the work-related activity group; age.
-- Schedule 11 paragraph 1 (the usual case): (a) s 2(2) or in the work-related activity group; (b) 25 or over; (c) under 25.
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 20 EQUALS 95.55
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 20 EQUALS 95.55
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 25 EQUALS 95.55
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 24 EQUALS 75.65
-- paragraph 1 does not mention s 2(3): a claimant under 25 who satisfies only s 2(3) gets (c)
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 24 EQUALS 75.65
-- Schedule 11 paragraph 2 (cases within paragraphs 2 to 7): (a) s 2(2) or (3); (b) 25 or over; (c) under 25.
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 20 EQUALS 95.55
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 20 EQUALS 95.55
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 25 EQUALS 95.55
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 24 EQUALS 75.65
-- paragraph 2 does not mention the work-related activity group: a claimant under 25 in it, who meets neither s 2(2) nor s 2(3), gets (c)
#ASSERT `art 30(2) and (3): the prescribed amount for a single claimant` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 24 EQUALS 75.65

§ `Articles 30(4) and (5) -- the pensioner premium (src:397-398, 748-765)`

-- Arguments: the case falls within paragraphs 2 to 7; paragraph 5 applies; member of a couple; entitled to the support component;
-- entitled to the work-related activity component.
-- Schedule 12 paragraph 1 (the usual case): the first table
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 93.95
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 164.60
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST 142.45
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST 213.10
-- the first table prints no row (i); its row (iii) is 'is not entitled to the support component' (src:751, 754), so a claimant
-- entitled to the work-related activity component and not to the support component is within (iii) (fork F-13)
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST 142.45
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST 213.10
-- paragraph 5 does not apply
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Schedule 12 paragraph 2 (cases within paragraphs 2 to 7): the second table
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST 105.90
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 93.95
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST 142.45
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST 176.55
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 164.60
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST 213.10
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the pensioner premium` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the carer premium (paragraph 11(3)) is set only in the usual case; in a case of art 30(5) the Order sets no sum for it
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the carer premium` FALSE 1 EQUALS JUST 48.15
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the carer premium` FALSE 2 EQUALS JUST 96.30
#ASSERT `art 30(4) and (5): the carer premium` TRUE 1 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 30(6) -- the components (src:401-404)`

#ASSERT `art 30(6)(b): the amount of the work-related activity component for the purposes of a contributory allowance` TRUE EQUALS JUST 37.95
#ASSERT `art 30(6)(b): the amount of the work-related activity component for the purposes of a contributory allowance` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `art 30(6)(c): the amount of the support component for the purposes of a contributory allowance` EQUALS 50.35

