#ASSERT `art 31(2): the sums in a case falling within paragraphs 2 to 7 of Schedule 2 to the ESA and UC Regulations 2017` `ESA 2013 regulation 62(2)(b) in the cases of art 31(2)` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the part 5 to 8 tests` 48.50 50.35)
#ASSERT `art 31(2): the sums in a case falling within paragraphs 2 to 7 of Schedule 2 to the ESA and UC Regulations 2017` `ESA 2013 regulation 62(2)(a) in the cases of art 31(2)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `art 31(3): the sums in regulation 62 as modified` `ESA 2013 regulation 62(1)(a)(i) and (ii)(aa) as modified` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the part 5 to 8 tests` 92.05 95.55)
#ASSERT `art 31(3): the sums in regulation 62 as modified` `ESA 2013 regulation 62(1)(a)(ii)(bb) as modified` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the part 5 to 8 tests` 72.90 75.65)
#ASSERT `art 31(3): the sums in regulation 62 as modified` `ESA 2013 regulation 62(1)(a)(ii)(bb) as modified` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

